===persian===

نشانی شوق را...
از نگاهِ من بپرس...
هر روز... پیش از آن که...
در آینهٔ اتفاق ببینی...
۱۳۸۴/۴

===machine===

Ask my eyes...
for the address of longing...
every day... before...
you catch sight of it in the mirror of chance...
1384/4

===lantern===

Ask my eyes
for the address of longing,
every day, before
you catch sight of it in the mirror of chance...

1384/4

